    "description": "As you enter the strong south sun warms you through the living room windows.  You can see the rear garden beckoning beyond the kitchen.  Bright and refreshed this Spanish/Med Edwardian cottage is ready for you to move in and thrive! The main level has two bedrooms/one deco bath w/new vanity and refinished tub, & a huge kitchen that features a separate dining nook + utility room for art area or home office.  Beyond the back door the opportunity for a culinary garden is obvious.  Imagine just stepping out to grab a little parsley or some thyme to enhance your latest creation or taking morning coffee in the sun.  A few more feet away, the detached garage provides space for laundry, storage and parking.  Downstairs, accessed through the side yard or driveway are a family room and bonus bath, more storage and space for the water heater/furnace.  The family room is amply lit by a large sliding glass door that opens to a private green space - calming to look at while you are working and a good opportunity for some fresh air.  Play soccer or hike in Glen Canyon; dine on Italian, French, Sushi, Thai, Chinese or Vietnamese cuisine; pick up a book or gourmet groceries in Glen Park Village!  Or go downtown on BART or hop a freeway or shuttle south to the Peninsula-the location is the best!"
  },
